  "source": "// A pure function expands to local combinational array words and a selector.\nmodule array_lookup(input [7:0] a, b, input [2:0] index, output [7:0] y);\n  function [7:0] lookup(input [7:0] x, z, input [2:0] address);\n    reg [7:0] words[0:3];\n    begin\n      words[0] = x;\n      words[1] = z;\n      words[2] = x ^ z;\n      words[3] = ~x;\n      lookup = words[address];\n    end\n  endfunction\n  assign y = lookup(a, b, index);\nendmodule\n"
}
